{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-17-1","title":"Isaiah 17:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Syria and Israel are threatened. 6 A remnant shall forsake idolatry. 9 The rest shall be plagued for their impiety. 12 The woe of Israel's enemies.</p>\n<p>A.M. cir. 3263. B.C. cir. 741. burden. 15:1; 19:1 Damascus. 7:8; Ge 14:15; 15:2; 1Ki 11:24; 1Ch 18:5; 2Ch 28:5,23; Jer 49:23-27 Am 1:3-5; Zec 9:1; Ac 9:2 Damascus is. 8:4; 10:9; 2Ki 16:9 a ruinous. 25:2; 37:26; Jer 49:2; Mic 1:6; 3:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-2","title":"Isaiah 17:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Aroer. Nu 32:34; De 2:36; 3:12; Jos 13:16; Jer 48:19 they shall. 5:17; 7:23-25; Eze 25:5; Zep 2:6 none. Jer 7:33</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-3","title":"Isaiah 17:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>fortress. 7:8,16; 8:4; 10:9; 2Ki 16:9; 17:6; Ho 1:4,6; 3:4; 5:13,14; 8:8 Ho 9:16,17; 10:14; 13:7,8,15,16; Am 2:6-9; 3:9-15; 5:25-27; 6:7-11 Am 8:14; 9:1-10; Mic 1:4-9 they shall. 16:14; 28:1-4; Ho 9:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-4","title":"Isaiah 17:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>the glory. 9:8,21; 10:4 the fatness. 10:16; 24:13,16; De 32:15-27; Eze 34:20; Zep 2:11; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-5","title":"Isaiah 17:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>as when. Jer 9:22; 51:33; Ho 6:11; Joe 3:13; Mt 13:30,39-42; Re 14:15-20 the valley. Jos 15:8; 18:16 the valley of the giants. 2Sa 5:18,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-6","title":"Isaiah 17:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>1:9; 10:22; 24:13; De 4:27; Jud 8:2; 1Ki 19:18; Eze 36:8-15 Eze 37:19-25; 39:29; Ob 1:5; Mic 7:1; Ro 9:27; 11:4-6,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-7","title":"Isaiah 17:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>10:20,21; 19:22; 22:11; 24:14,15; 29:18,19,24; Jud 10:15,16 2Ch 30:10,11,18-20; 31:1; 35:17,18; Jer 3:12-14,18-23; 31:4-10 Ho 3:5; 6:1; 14:1-3; Mic 7:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-8","title":"Isaiah 17:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he shall. 1:29; 2:18-21; 27:9; 30:22; 2Ch 34:6,7; Eze 36:25; Ho 14:8; Zep 1:3 Zec 13:2 the work. 2:8; 31:6,7; 44:15,19,20; Ho 8:4-6; 10:1,2; 13:1,2; Mic 5:13,14 images. or, sun-images. 2Ch 14:5; 34:4; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-9","title":"Isaiah 17:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>4,5; 6:11-13; 7:16-20; 9:9-12; 24:1-12; 27:10; 28:1-4; Ho 10:14 Ho 13:15,16; Am 3:11-15; 7:9; Mic 5:11; 6:16; 7:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-10","title":"Isaiah 17:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thou hast. 51:13; De 6:12; 8:11,14,19; Ps 9:17; 106:13,21; Jer 2:32; 17:13 Ho 2:13,14; 4:6; 8:14; 13:6,7 the God. 12:2; 1Ch 16:35; Ps 65:5; 68:19,20; 79:9; 85:4; Hab 3:18 the rock. 26:4; De 32:4,15; Ps 18:2; 31:2 shalt thou. 65:21,22; Le 26:16,20; De 28:30,38-42; Jer 12:13; Am 5:11 Zep 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-11","title":"Isaiah 17:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>the harvest. 18:5,6; Job 4:8; Jer 5:31; Ho 8:7; 9:1-4,16; 10:12-15; Joe 1:5-12 Ga 6:7,8 a heap in the day of grief and of desperate sorrow. or,removed in the day of inheritance, and there shall be deadly sorrow. 65:13,14; Mt 8:11,12; Ro 2:5,8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-12","title":"Isaiah 17:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>multitude. or, noise. 9:5 make a noise. 5:26-30; 8:7,8; 28:17; Ps 18:4; 46:1-3; 65:6,7; 93:3,4; Jer 6:23 Eze 43:2; Lu 21:25 mighty. or, many. Ps 29:3; Re 17:1,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-13","title":"Isaiah 17:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>but. 10:15,16,33,34; 14:25; 25:4,5; 27:1; 30:30-33; 31:8,9; 33:1-3,9-12 37:29-38; Ps 9:5; 46:5-11 rebuke. Job 38:11; Mr 4:39-41 shall be. 29:5; 41:15,16; Job 21:18; Ps 1:4; 35:5; 83:13-15; Da 2:35; Ho 13:3 a rolling thing. or, thistle-down.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-17-14","title":"Isaiah 17:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":17,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":17,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>at evening-tide. 10:28-32; 2Ki 19:3,35; Ps 37:36 the portion. 33:1; Jud 5:31; Job 20:29; Pr 22:23; Jer 2:3; 13:25; Eze 39:10 Hab 2:16,17; Zep 2:9,10</p>"}]}